# Copy to <title folder>/data/debug.txt on the console to test (delete the file for normal play).
# "level N" starts directly in level N (1..13) without the menu; other lines are console commands run at level start.
# "level 14" does not exist in OpenClaw: it plays the two ending videos and then shows the menu.
level 5
invincible on
infinitejump on
# catnip / firesword / frostsword / lightningsword / invulnerable / invisible give 30 s powerups
# teleport 12600 4100
